      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Order matters: create cstam-vip first, then the gateway ports that list 10.20.0.10 as allowed address. Remove the 'default' SG from every CSTAM VM.\nBudget: 7/10 instances, 17/20 vCPU (with the 2 existing VMs), 5 security groups (~36 of 100 rules).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1918187054,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Order matters: create cstam-vip first, then the gateway ports that list 10.20.0.10 as allowed address. Remove the 'default' SG from every CSTAM VM.\nBudget: 7/10 instances, 17/20 vCPU (with the 2 existing VMs), 5 security groups (~36 of 100 rules).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792172606668,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 243420826,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
